Package: bsikompendium
Type: Package
Title: Offline Checks Supporting BSI IT-Grundschutz Assessments
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(person("Dimitrios", "Geromichalos", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "riskdatascience@web.de"), person("RiskDataScience GmbH", role = "cph"))
Description: Supports structured information security assessments based on
    the German BSI IT-Grundschutz Compendium, Edition 2023, including errata
    dated 2026-03-26, and BSI Standards 200-1, 200-2 and 200-3
    (2017) <https://www.bsi.bund.de/grundschutz>. Provides an indexed
    requirement catalogue, individually derived assessment contracts, protection needs,
    risk assessment and selected technical checks. Runs locally and requires
    qualified user assessments; it does not certify compliance.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite, stats
